{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"hekiryuu","id":"237577351532249110","is_bot":0,"username":"hekiryuu"},"author_id":"237577351532249110","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"The cobbled streets are grimy, the air thick and moist.  Windows are covered in a film from not being cared for in far too long.  Most of the buildings are wooden, or a mix of wood and stone.  Swarms of insects are seen flying throughout the borough.  Each street has a muck gutter on either side.  A notice is posted:\n```Notice, all silver is property of the crown.  Anyone found to have silver on them will have it confiscated and will be fined 10 gold, or spend a day in the stocks\n\nFurther, No one without a pass is to be out on the streets between the hours of 10pm and 6am.  Violation of this order will result in a 100 gold fine, and up to 3 days locked up.```","created_at":"2021-06-06T20:33:18.652000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-08T16:48:12.709000Z","id":"851197081271664690","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
{"attachments":[],"author":{"display_name":"Devloot","id":"246711433730064384","is_bot":0,"username":"devon8642"},"author_id":"246711433730064384","channel_id":"851195289850347540","content":"Tortillini flies over the grungy streets, then careens down straight into the ocean like a bird of prey. He pushes the air out of his lungs, not like he needs it, and starts walking along the bottom of the ocean looking for anything of value. (I'm going to be gone for a few hours. Going to surface in ferrytown port I guess, seems much more oceany)","created_at":"2021-07-10T21:53:31.942000Z","edited_at":"2021-07-10T23:40:42.582000Z","id":"863538457104482326","reply_to_id":null,"thread":null,"thread_id":null}
